# This file contains the initial defaults for go command configuration.
# Values set by 'go env -w' and written to the user's go/env file override these.
# The environment overrides everything else.

# GOPROXY and GOSUMDB are removed. The go command always uses the Go module
# mirror and checksum database. See RemovedEnv in cmd/go/internal/cfg.

# GOTOOLCHAIN is removed, so there is no line for it here. This fork always
# runs itself. A go.mod go or toolchain directive newer than this fork's
# version fails loudly rather than downloading an official Go toolchain and
# losing cosmo support. See RemovedEnv in cmd/go/internal/cfg.
